Split the sentence into words on runs of spaces (dropping empty pieces), reverse each word, and join them with single spaces. O(n) time, O(n) space.

def reverseWords(sentence):
    return ' '.join(word[::-1] for word in sentence.split())

Binary search the capacity between max(weights) (the heaviest package must fit) and sum(weights) (everything in one day). For a candidate capacity a greedy pass counts the days needed; a bigger capacity never needs more days, so search for the smallest feasible one. O(n log(sum)) time, O(1) space.

def min_truck_capacity(weights, days):
