Example 1 → {"added": [4], "removed": [2], "changed": [3]}
Example 2 → {"added": [], "removed": [], "changed": [5]}
Hidden test 1 → diffSnapshots([], []) = {"added": [], "removed": [], "changed": []}  (two empty snapshots)
Hidden test 2 → diffSnapshots([], [{"id": 2, "v": 1}, {"id": 1, "v": 1}]) = {"added": [1, 2], "removed": [], "changed": []}  (everything is new and the ids must be sorted)

